---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How MotoOptix handles information submitted through its business inquiry website.">
  <header class="policy-hero"><p class="kicker dark"><span></span> Legal</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated: August 9, 2026</p></header>
  <article class="policy-content">
    <p>This policy explains how MotoOptix uses information provided through this business inquiry website. Company identity, address and governing-law details must be completed before public launch.</p>
    <h2>Information we collect</h2><p>When you submit a buying brief, we may collect your name, business email, company, buyer type, estimated quantity, product interest, target market and the requirements you choose to provide. Basic server logs may also include IP address, browser information, requested pages and timestamps.</p>
    <h2>Why we use it</h2><p>We use inquiry information to evaluate your request, recommend suitable product configurations, prepare quotations, arrange samples, prevent spam and maintain a record of business communications. We do not sell submitted contact information.</p>
    <h2>Legal basis and business communications</h2><p>Depending on your location, processing may be based on your consent, steps requested before entering a contract, our legitimate interest in responding to business inquiries, or a legal obligation. We will not add you to unrelated marketing campaigns merely because you requested a quotation.</p>
    <h2>Service providers and international processing</h2><p>Hosting, email, form-delivery, analytics or security providers may process limited information on our behalf. Because this is an international B2B website, information may be processed in countries other than your own. Appropriate provider terms and safeguards should be confirmed before launch.</p>
    <h2>Retention</h2><p>Inquiry records are kept only as long as reasonably necessary for evaluation, commercial follow-up, fraud prevention, accounting or legal requirements. Unqualified inquiries should be deleted or anonymized on a defined schedule.</p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may request access, correction or deletion of your submitted information, subject to applicable law and legitimate record-keeping requirements. The operational privacy email will be published here before launch.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>This initial site does not intentionally set advertising cookies. If analytics, advertising or embedded third-party media are added later, this section and any required consent controls must be updated first.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>Privacy contact details and the responsible legal entity will be inserted when the trading entity and production domain are confirmed.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
